# 17. ENHANCEMENT FEATURE — BUSINESS PURPOSE

Explain why this feature exists.

It is NOT an automatic prompt rewriting system.

Workflow:

`Initial Step-1 output`
→ `inspect output + retrieval quality`
→ `diagnosis`
→ `NOT_RECOMMENDED or RECOMMENDED`

If RECOMMENDED:

→ show guided suggestion
→ user may Edit / Dismiss / Apply & Rescan
→ feedback consolidation
→ runtime guidance
→ rescan/re-enrichment

Explain:

* user remains in control
* no silent rescan
* no permanent prompt modification
* no invented new research direction
* existing feedback remains available

